      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5461481::rubric_mechanisms::001::8100474dc6"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid SPS will suppress Laves-phase precipitation in CoCrFeNiTi.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti-rich segregation or slow cooling typically promotes brittle HCP phases and Laves precipitates in this alloy system.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The effective sintering-temperature window is 1100–1250 °C, while temperatures above about 1300 °C cause loss of entropy stabilization.",
      "field": "conditions; boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A heating rate above 100 °C/s and a dwell time below 10 minutes are required to preserve the proposed nanocrystalline dual-phase structure.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An applied SPS pressure of 50–100 MPa is suitable for achieving near-theoretical density.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An inert sintering atmosphere minimizes oxidation of the milled powder.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nanocrystalline grain boundaries act as sinks for vacancies and solute segregation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid thermal input and short dwell time restrict the diffusion required for HCP nucleation and Laves precipitation.",
