      "text": "Milling-induced defects provide nucleation sites for the FCC phase.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Configurational entropy stabilizes the FCC phase at the proposed sintering temperatures.",
